00:20:19,042 --> 00:20:23,120
What do you think, Anne? You're the
person he wronged, after all.

240
00:20:26,180 --> 00:20:31,110
Stand up, Jonas. Right now.

241
00:20:45,710 --> 00:20:47,528
There. I knew I'd feel
better if I could give

242
00:20:47,612 --> 00:20:49,118
him a good slap in the face.

243
00:20:49,232 --> 00:20:52,310
Very direct.
I like the way you think.

244
00:20:55,310 --> 00:20:57,290
Well, hell,
I suppose we're done here.

245
00:20:59,330 --> 00:21:05,900
Sorry. Excuse me. Pardon me. Oh.

246
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:15,158
Thank you. Shall.
I wanted to be a silver sugar

247
00:21:15,242 --> 00:21:16,958
master so I could make
mama proud

248
00:21:17,042 --> 00:21:18,470
when I sent her to the heavens.

249
00:21:19,500 --> 00:21:23,058
Despite everything, I failed.
So mama will have

250
00:21:23,142 --> 00:21:24,528
to be content
