253
00:21:35,070 --> 00:21:40,800
Anyway, I promise the sugar confection to
you. Remember? Please take it.

254
00:21:42,780 --> 00:21:46,368
It looks awful. Awful.
I wanted a truly

255
00:21:46,452 --> 00:21:49,578
delicious piece made by a
genuine silver sugar master.

256
00:21:49,662 --> 00:21:51,588
What's wrong with you?
So it's not

257
00:21:51,672 --> 00:21:55,038
good enough now?
I told you, I'm not.

258
00:21:55,122 --> 00:21:57,258
A silver sugar master just yet.
But

259
00:21:57,342 --> 00:22:02,390
I know I'll get it next year.
Then I'll have it in a year.

260
00:22:03,090 --> 00:22:05,598
I don't need it till then.
Until you

261
00:22:05,682 --> 00:22:09,240
achieve that title.
I'll wait by your side.

262
00:22:10,620 --> 00:22:16,180
Are you sure? And did he just.

263
00:22:21,090 --> 00:22:25,420
For the first time.
He used my name.

264
00:22:35,710 --> 00:22:38,758
What did you think of my
brilliant award winning acting work?

265
00:22:38,872 --> 00:22:42,028
Oh, mithril. I'm really sorry.
I never

266
00:22:42,112 --> 00:22:44,488
