had eaten my silver sugar,

267
00:22:44,572 --> 00:22:46,498
even for a second. Don't worry.

268
00:22:46,582 --> 00:22:49,078
About it. I know that's just
the way you humans operate.

269
00:22:49,162 --> 00:22:52,948
And I told you my full
name is Mithril Lid Pod.

270
00:22:53,062 --> 00:22:54,928
Then tell me something.
Mithril lid pod.

271
00:22:55,042 --> 00:22:58,738
How did you figure out that Jonas
had stolen my sugar confection?

272
00:22:58,822 --> 00:23:01,618
Have you been following us
