273
00:23:01,792 --> 00:23:04,678
No. I went back to your
cart after you accused me.

274
00:23:04,762 --> 00:23:08,188
Huh? I was upset,
so I went to bed in a huff.

275
00:23:08,272 --> 00:23:10,540
And when I woke up,
Jonas had taken the car.

276
00:23:11,260 --> 00:23:15,280
Oh, so that's what happened. How
long were you asleep, anyway?

277
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:17,578
Listen,
the important thing is that I'm

278
00:23:17,662 --> 00:23:18,718
