I have to be.

280
00:23:21,290 --> 00:23:23,918
I said I'd follow you
into the underworld. Right.

281
00:23:24,032 --> 00:23:26,198
Mr. Lidford,
do you know what I mean

282
00:23:26,282 --> 00:23:28,580
