my real name earlier.

287
00:23:40,220 --> 00:23:42,788
Hurry on up, Scarecrow.
Get in the cart.

288
00:23:42,902 --> 00:23:46,008
Fine. I suppose I'll let it pass
this time, but. Name is Ian.

289
00:23:46,122 --> 00:23:49,680
Let's go. Are you going
to drive? That's right.

290
00:23:51,580 --> 00:23:53,320
That's just the mood I'm in.

